19451	"MDX-1303 is a fully human antibody against the inhalation anthrax, the most lethal form of illness in humans caused by the Bacillus anthracis bacterium, and targets a protein component of these lethal toxins known as the anthrax protective antigen."	""	"Investigated for use/treatment in anthrax exposure and bacterial infection."	"MDX-1303 targets a protein component of lethal toxins produced by the bacterium known as the anthrax protective antigen. The anthrax protective antigen initiates the onset of the illness by attaching to cells in the infected person, and then facilitates the entry of additional destructive toxins into the cells. MDX-1303 is designed to target anthrax protective antigen and protect the cells from damage by the anthrax toxins."	""	""	"MDX-1303 is a solid."	""	""	""	""	""	"MDX-1303 is investigational."	""	""	""	""
